OL,3,GNEWSASuspensions over boys' team
OL,4,Aabusive messages claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boys' football club has suspended a
OL,7,Fnumber of players after allegations of
OL,8,Fracist and ableist abuse against a
OL,9,Frival club.
OL,11,FClaims of "deeply disturbing and
OL,12,Fhate-filled messages" being circulated
OL,13,Fon WhatsApp by members of Kinsley Boys
OL,14,FFC followed a fixture with Route One
OL,15,FRovers FC in Bradford on 7 November.
OL,17,FKinsley Boys FC confirmed on Friday
OL,18,Fthat a number of its players had been
OL,19,Fsuspended pending the outcome an
OL,20,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
