OL,3,GNEWSASuspensions over boys' team
OL,4,Aabusive messages claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said the team was
OL,7,Fworking with the Football Association
OL,8,F(FA) and Northern Counties East
OL,9,FFootball League to ensure the matter
OL,10,Fwas investigated "thoroughly, fairly
OL,11,Fand in accordance with the relevant
OL,12,Fregulations".
